{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/Gif_V4_GameplayResized.gif?t=1744035608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bug Hunters</strong> is an <strong>incremental</strong> game where you fight against <strong>waves of enemies and bosses</strong> through <strong>various stages</strong>, <strong>maps</strong>, and <strong>challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/extras/Gif_V4_Second.gif?t=1744035608\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your earnings to <strong>buy upgrades</strong> in the <strong>skill tree</strong>, <strong>characters</strong>, or other goods. Each character has <strong>unique features</strong>, weaknesses, and strengths, so pick the one that suits you best to win. Also, upgrades are varied and you can make multiple <strong>custom builds</strong> or <strong>synergies</strong>. These <strong>upgrades give</strong> <strong>new or empower old passives</strong>, award <strong>new abilities</strong>, unlock <strong>more skill trees</strong>, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A map is made up of multiple stages and there's also <strong>post-end content</strong>, so get ready to fight a lot of bugs and protect your system against these threats.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274970?t=1744035608","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3274970?t=1744035608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/e044f7476809117d9bde39815df44ee73468e5aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744035608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274970/e044f7476809117d9bde39815df44ee73468e5aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744035608","ca